	(text "NES 72-pin edge drawn by function (finger numbers on the pins). Pin 1 is at the RIGHT seen\nfrom the label side with the fingers down (nesdev; NES-EWROM-01 geometry).\nEXP0-9, SYSTEM CLK and PPU /A13 are not used. The CIClone (ATtiny13A) is DNP until its firmware exists."
